      "page_content": {
        "hero_section": {
          "h1_title": "Thank you!",
          "h2_subtitle": "This message is being shown by the custom code written in the callback function \"onUrxFormSubmitSuccess\"",
          "cta_buttons": []
        },
        "value_props": [],
        "main_content": [
          {
            "tag": "h1",
            "text": "Infuse intelligence into operations"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Leverage AI and automation to optimize asset maintenance, reduce downtime, ensure compliance across multisite operations. Let’s create smarter business."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h5",
            "text": "Recommended for you"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Get the IBM® Granite® Cookbook Explore AI courses, APIs, data sets and more Maximize ROI through smarter governance Why IBM? See what the analysts have to say and start your hands-on journey."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "See why Granite Vision tops the SLMs chart in doc understanding Forrester names IBM a Q3 2025 leader in AI Governance Solutions Optimize performance with AI-infused monitoring and maintenance with Maximo Lead in the AI era with IBM From next-generation AI to cutting-edge software , our deep expertise across industries can help you reinvent how your business works in the age of AI."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Automate your complex workflows with AI agents and assistants"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Access, integrate, govern and secure all your enterprise data from one place—wherever it resides"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Discover how automation solutions increase productivity while managing costs"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Manage your hybrid cloud environment to run workloads where and when you need them"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Get started with cost-efficient AI models, tailored for business and optimized for scale"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Support data-driven decisions for your business"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Secure hybrid cloud and AI with data and identity-centric cybersecurity solutions"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Engage with IBM Consulting® to design, build and operate high-performing businesses"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Explore IBM history and culture of putting technology to work in the real world."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Visit the IBM lab and see what&#39;s in store for the future of computing."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "See what it takes to become an IBMer or build your skills with our educational courses."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "See what it takes to become an IBMer, or build your skills with our educational courses."
